/target
.env
.codegraph
.DS_Store
/benchmark/node_modules/
/canary-artifacts
benchmark/**/sentinel.txt

# A worktree an agent opens inside the clone. The benchmark freezes a round
# against a commit and a clean tree, and an untracked worktree here reads as
# dirty, so it refuses to start a round that nothing about it affects.
/.worktrees

# The benchmark control plane. A set is evidence for a published claim, not
# source, so it is attached to the release that cites it. Only the note stays.
benchmark/runs/*
!benchmark/runs/README.md
